^{:go/end 122} (go/func ParsePKCS1PrivateKey "ParsePKCS1PrivateKey parses an [RSA] private key in PKCS #1, ASN.1 DER form.\n\nThis kind of key is commonly encoded in PEM blocks of type \"RSA PRIVATE KEY\".\n\nBefore Go 1.24, the CRT parameters were ignored and recomputed. To restore\nthe old behavior, use the GODEBUG=x509rsacrt=0 environment variable.\n" [^{:tag (slice byte)} der] :results [(* rsa/PrivateKey) error]
